Real-world GeoServer SLD sample styles. All 24 files are **SLD 1.0.0**
(`CssParameter`, no `se:` namespace, `<ogc:...>` filters) — the version
GeoServer emits and consumes by default, distinct from the SLD 1.1.0 /
SE 1.1.0 the `sld_se` codec targets. A handful carry GeoServer
`<VendorOption>` elements and GeoServer-specific `<ogc:Function>` calls.

See README.md for how the tests use this corpus. To refresh: re-pull the
path above at a newer commit, update this file, review the diff.
